  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 11pt; margin-bottom: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Brand introduction:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Ellie is your go-to destination for stylish, high-quality activewear delivered straight to your door. With our $49.95 monthly subscription, you&rsquo;ll receive a credit to use toward a complete 3-piece activewear outfit&mdash;at a price that&rsquo;s less than what you&rsquo;d spend on a single piece elsewhere. Choose from pre-styled sets or mix and match separates to create your perfect look while enjoying exclusive member pricing. Say goodbye to the hassle of shopping and hello to effortless, affordable activewear designed to fit your lifestyle.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 11pt; margin-bottom: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Product description: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Whether you&rsquo;re crushing workouts or keeping it casual, our 3-piece outfits blend comfort, performance, and style, perfect for gym days or off-duty looks. Choose pre-styled sets or mix and match separates, all at exclusive member pricing. Look good, feel great, and let Ellie take care of the rest.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 11pt; margin-bottom: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">USP:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\